# How to obtain:
# 1. Go to Apple Developer > Certificates, Identifiers & Profiles > Keys
# 2. Create a new key with "Apple Push Notifications service (APNs)" enabled
# 3. Download the .p8 file
# 4. Copy it to this directory as "apns-key.p8"
